      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5fca5df4d58780532024a52b|full_name}: Yup. It however makes me wonder whether it was the right tradeoffs to make. I personally found the issues I previously encountered not nearly as bothersome as the ones that these fixes bring.\n \nFor example, seeing world objects through the personal mirror only happened in some cases (and if so you could just readjust the position of the mirror), but the new issues with avatars are pretty much in view all of the time and therefore completely unavoidable. I'd take the previous implementation any day.",
